  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34674742",
      "title": "Paths: Absolute vs Relative",
      "lectureOrder": 47,
      "videoOrder": 42,
      "sourceHash": "507fb2c6d7d7e92a5728df2363ff32df6e3a27d48a03ce468b40d76d019f8096",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 5.19,
          "en": "Now where else could we use links?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.19,
          "end": 8.19,
          "en": "For example here in the Auth Form component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.19,
          "end": 10.8,
          "en": "but I'll get back to that link a little bit later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.8,
          "end": 13.5,
          "en": "because there is something special I wanna do with it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.4,
          "end": 15.9,
          "en": "Therefore, instead, let's take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.9,
          "end": 18.06,
          "en": "at the expense list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.06,
          "end": 19.92,
          "en": "There I have this added link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.92,
          "end": 23.313,
          "en": "and this link should load the added page if we click it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.36,
          "end": 26.97,
          "en": "Now, the special thing about the added page of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.97,
          "end": 31.65,
          "en": "is that we have this variable path segment here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.65,
          "end": 34.2,
          "en": "So we can't say /expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.2,
          "end": 36.03,
          "en": "slash edit or something like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.03,
          "end": 38.57,
          "en": "but instead we need the ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.57,
          "end": 40.473,
          "en": "of the expense that should be edited.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.52,
          "end": 44.28,
          "en": "Now to get that ID we could do the following.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.28,
          "end": 49.14,
          "en": "We could expect that ID as a prop here on expense list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.14,
          "end": 51.87,
          "en": "And then in the expenses list component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.87,
          "end": 54.39,
          "en": "where we render those expense list items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.39,
          "end": 57.6,
          "en": "we must make sure that this prop is provided.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.6,
          "end": 59.91,
          "en": "And indeed, in the component I provided to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.91,
          "end": 61.62,
          "en": "that should already be the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.62,
          "end": 63.81,
          "en": "If not, simply add the ID prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.81,
          "end": 67.443,
          "en": "and pass expense.id as a value to that prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.76,
          "end": 71.4,
          "en": "With that, we get the ID off the expense list item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.4,
          "end": 72.93,
          "en": "that is being rendered here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.93,
          "end": 74.31,
          "en": "as a prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.31,
          "end": 76.38,
          "en": "And now for this link here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.38,
          "end": 78.03999999999999,
          "en": "we wanna create a relative link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.03999999999999,
          "end": 79.657,
          "en": "where we simply point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.657,
          "end": 81.42,
          "en": "at that ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.42,
          "end": 82.563,
          "en": "which we get here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.4,
          "end": 85.53,
          "en": "Now this is a relative link because it doesn't",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.53,
          "end": 87.57300000000001,
          "en": "start with a slash (/) at the beginning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.59,
          "end": 91.44,
          "en": "Instead, it's just the ID without a leading slash (/)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 91.44,
          "end": 93.81,
          "en": "and therefore a relative path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 93.81,
          "end": 96.946,
          "en": "And this relative path will simply be appended",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 96.946,
          "end": 99.453,
          "en": "after the currently active path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.32,
          "end": 102.78,
          "en": "Now, since the expense list item is rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 102.78,
          "end": 104.49000000000001,
          "en": "on the expenses component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 104.49000000000001,
          "end": 107.00999999999999,
          "en": "which is loaded for /expenses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 107.00999999999999,
          "end": 111.45,
          "en": "the ID is simply appended after /expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 111.45,
          "end": 113.22,
          "en": "And that's exactly the kind of link we need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.22,
          "end": 116.03999999999999,
          "en": "because for /expenses/<some-id>",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 116.03999999999999,
          "end": 118.203,
          "en": "we wanna load this page, this route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 119.19,
          "end": 121.11,
          "en": "So that would work as expected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 121.11,
          "end": 123.87,
          "en": "However, of course, here I also wanna use the remix link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 123.87,
          "end": 126,
          "en": "not the default anchor element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 126,
          "end": 127.89,
          "en": "and therefore we also import link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 127.89,
          "end": 131.85,
          "en": "from '@remix-run/react' here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 131.85,
          "end": 135.36,
          "en": "and then replace the anchor element with that link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 135.36,
          "end": 138.423,
          "en": "and replace the href attribute with the 'to' prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 140.713,
          "end": 142.07999999999998,
          "en": "Now, with that done,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 142.07999999999998,
          "end": 144.48,
          "en": "if we click this edit button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 144.48,
          "end": 146.13,
          "en": "we load the edit page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 146.13,
          "end": 148.71,
          "en": "And if you take a look at the URL you will notice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 148.71,
          "end": 151.653,
          "en": "that different IDs are encoded in that URL.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
